cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Karachi Heat Priority Map"
abstract: >
  A free, mobile-first map to help a Karachi relief team decide where heat-relief
  support should go first during a heatwave, and why. Pilot area: Landhi Town.
  Priority is a weighted geometric mean of hazard (Landsat surface temperature),
  exposure (modelled population) and vulnerability, on an H3 resolution-9 grid.
type: software
authors:
